{"id":"1d8b7c4f4962933d","group":"90","path":"90/90-book-info.md","title":"Diagonalization and Self-Reference — Raymond Smullyan","display":"Diagonalization and Self-Reference — Raymond Smullyan","type":"book","metadata":{"type":"book","book":"Diagonalization and Self-Reference","book_abbrev":"90","label":"90-book-info","aliases":["90-book-info"],"display":"Diagonalization and Self-Reference — Raymond Smullyan","depends_on":[]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"book"},{"key":"book","html":"Diagonalization and Self-Reference"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"90"},{"key":"label","html":"90-book-info"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>90-book-info</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"Diagonalization and Self-Reference — Raymond Smullyan"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<span class=\"property-null\">无</span>"}],"html":"<h1 id=\"Diagonalization-and-Self-Reference\">Diagonalization and Self-Reference</h1>\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"B_{90}\">\\(B_{90}\\)</span> (book identifier, standard symbol)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{DiagonalizationSelfReference}\">\\(\\mathrm{DiagonalizationSelfReference}\\)</span> (book-topic constant, standard local symbol)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{book\\text{-}info}_{90} \\vdash B_{90} = \\mathrm{DiagonalizationSelfReference}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{book\\text{-}info}_{90} \\vdash B_{90} = \\mathrm{DiagonalizationSelfReference}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<h3 id=\"Author\">Author</h3>\n<p>Raymond Smullyan</p>\n<h3 id=\"Description\">Description</h3>\n<p>关于对角化和自指现象的系统性研究，涵盖哥德尔定理、Tarski定理、递归论等多个领域的核心结果。本书以清晰严谨的方式展示了对角化方法在数学逻辑中的广泛应用。</p>\n<h3 id=\"Core-Topics\">Core Topics</h3>\n<ul>\n<li>Diagonalization (对角化)</li>\n<li>Self-Reference (自指)</li>\n<li>Gödel's Theorem (哥德尔定理)</li>\n<li>Tarski's Theorem (Tarski定理)</li>\n<li>Recursion Theorem (递归定理)</li>\n<li>Fixed Point Theorems (不动点定理)</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Diagonalization-and-Self-Reference","text":"Diagonalization and Self-Reference","level":1},{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2},{"id":"Author","text":"Author","level":3},{"id":"Description","text":"Description","level":3},{"id":"Core-Topics","text":"Core Topics","level":3}],"links":[],"math":[{"tex":"B_{90}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{DiagonalizationSelfReference}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{book\\text{-}info}_{90} \\vdash B_{90} = \\mathrm{DiagonalizationSelfReference}","display":true}],"bytes":1011,"backlinks":[],"outgoing":[]}